{"id":"427681","name":"花㬵淮山肉汤","author":"老U爱小轩哥","authorId":"5899877","desc":"","cover":"images/427681/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"淮山","amount":"半根"},{"name":"花胶","amount":"6个"},{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"1块"},{"name":"猪𦟌","amount":"2块"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"3片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"材料如图。","img":"images/427681/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"花胶温水泡软。","img":"images/427681/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"淮山去皮切段。","img":"images/427681/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入锅中，今天懒人歺，随便在汤上蒸一碗米饭。","img":"images/427681/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"花胶洗净后用开水烫一下，去腥。","img":"images/427681/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"肉飞水去腥，洗净后放入。","img":"images/427681/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入凉水，没过食材。","img":"images/427681/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"高压锅50分钟后，开盖再大火煮15分钟。","img":"images/427681/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"喜欢青豌豆，随手丢进去煮熟。","img":"images/427681/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}